    {
      "Id": 2005607013,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005607,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哦……比想象中像样。/n摆放平衡不怎么样，不过颜色丰富，看起来挺好吃。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20056070110",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 200,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005607014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005607,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那先从这份胡萝卜丝开始。/n这好像是绯花里老家的菜……叫胡萝卜丝炒蛋来着？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20056070120",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005607015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005607,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "绯花里",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我要做的是冲绳家常菜，胡萝卜丝丝炒蛋。/n我也特别喜欢，每次都会吃太多！",
      "VoiceFileName": "20056070130",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "305"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005607016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005607,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……这什么。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20056070140",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 106,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30301,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005607017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005607,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "切丝有点粗，味道也怪。/n不过甜味正好，要说好入口倒也确实好入口……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20056070150",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005607018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005607,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这个是棒棒鸡吧。看来是故意照顾中国口味。/n……嗯！？　这个香味，是豆干辣！",
      "VoiceFileName": "20056070160",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 506,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 15,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005607019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005607,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "莉莉亚",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "拉莫，对王雪来说，这种香料是家乡的味道。/n我知道，她病刚好，所以辣度会少一点。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20056070170",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "304"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005607020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005607,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "咳咳咳！/n水、水……水！",
      "VoiceFileName": "20056070180",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 504,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 5,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30301,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005607021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005607,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "鸡肉有点柴，而且比想象中辣。/n这个酱十有八九是芬兰调的……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20056070190",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
