    {
      "Id": 2005607024,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005607,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "味道也很好地煮进去了，/n尤其姜味很足，这点让我很高兴。身体开始暖起来了……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20056070220",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 101,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005607025,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005607,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 24,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "能做得这么贴心的，是千寿历小姐吗。/n不，搞不好意外是德国。那家伙总会莫名其妙替别人操心。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20056070230",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 210,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 21,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005607026,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005607,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 25,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "然后是这个煎蛋饼。/n外表是最漂亮的，值得期待。",
